      "source": "Sets the default <a href=\"../UrlBasedViewResolver.html#setViewClass(java.lang.Class)\"><code>view class</code></a> to <a href=\"#requiredViewClass()\"><code>requiredViewClass()</code></a>:\nby default <a href=\"GroovyMarkupView.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.view.groovy\"><code>GroovyMarkupView</code></a>.",
