    {
      "source": "A convenience constructor that allows for specifying the <a href=\"../UrlBasedViewResolver.html#setPrefix(java.lang.String)\"><code>prefix</code></a>\nand <a href=\"../UrlBasedViewResolver.html#setSuffix(java.lang.String)\"><code>suffix</code></a> as constructor arguments.",
