      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The view class for all views created by this resolver can be specified\nvia <a href=\"../UrlBasedViewResolver.html#setViewClass(java.lang.Class)\"><code>UrlBasedViewResolver.setViewClass(Class)</code></a>.",
